  "captureMaterial": {"role": "截图内容的模拟磨砂底层，不是 Host 控件主题或真实桌面截图", "implementation": "src/client/capture/material.ts", "nativeReference": {"system": "macOS 27.0.1 (26A434)", "view": "NSVisualEffectView", "material": "sidebar", "state": "active", "blendingMode": "behindWindow", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/appkit/nsvisualeffectview"}, "acquisition": "自有离屏 NSVisualEffectView 的 CALayer 只读取证，未激活窗口、未请求录屏；研究参数固化为编辑 recipe，该材质绘制自身不调用取像 helper 或私有 API；RC 的整窗取像另由显式调用的原生 helper 完成。", "light": {"blurRadius": 30, "saturation": 2.2, "fillSrgb": 0.9647, "fillAlpha": 0.84, "toneSrgb": 0.915, "toneBlend": "darken"}, "dark": {"blurRadius": 30, "saturation": 2.4, "fillSrgb": 0.1569, "fillAlpha": 0.8, "toneSrgb": 0.14, "toneBlend": "lighten"}, "limits": "只模糊用户选择的编辑背景，原始 PNG 无滤镜并保留。缺少真实桌面背景、Chameleon 桌面着色及 SDR 归一化，Canvas blur 不是 Core Animation 的逐像素复刻；后续系统版本不保证参数一致。透明选项仅使窗口外围透明，窗口内部保留材质底层。"},
